    "description": "INVALID (esm-spec §9.6.12 'Arity'): definitions of `twice` are in scope (one parameter), and the call twice(w, w) carries two operands, so loading fails with `operator_arity_mismatch`. A call of `other` (no definitions in scope) would be a placeholder, whatever its arity.",
